r spoiled unit). Ordering about 1.05 × forecast is reasonable.\n   - Because the plans are fixed in advance, any steady over-ordering builds up as spoilage and unsold stock at the end. Any steady under-ordering keeps the shelf near zero, so shortages happen often.\n\n| Plan | Ordering | Product 0 / product 1 vs forecast | Assessment |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| 0 | every other day | ≈1.10 / 1.07 | best combination |\n| 4 | daily | ≈1.12 / 1.05 | well-chosen levels |\n| 2 | daily | ≈1.05 / 1.00 | slightly too little product 0 |\n| 1 | every third day | ≈1.12 / 1.08 | holding cost and capacity risk |\n| 7 | every other day | ≈1.30 / 1.15 | over-orders, so spoilage and leftover product 1 |\n| 5 | daily | ≈1.00 / 0.96 | frequent shortages |\n| 3 | daily | ≈1.29 / 1.14 | over-orders |\n| 6 | daily | ≈1.20 / 0.79 | heavy product 1 shortages |"}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 4283, "cache_read_input_tokens": 2313, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 4283}, "output_tokens": 3, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-28T22:52:50.263Z", "request_id": "req_011CgVTL71ABae2BYEcpBrjn"}, {"type": "stream_event", "event": {"type": "content_block_stop", "index": 1}, "parent_tool_use_id": null}, {"type": "stream_event", "event": {"type": "content_block_start", "index": 2, "content_block": {"type": "tool_use", "id": "toolu_01WwcKcJVHL95pcP8vNd5MD3", "name": "StructuredOutput", "input": {}, "caller": {"type": "direct"}}}, "parent_tool_use_id": null}, {"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-opus-5-5", "id": "msg_011CgVTL7WgCSaRcwBdQyyAh", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "tool_use", "id": "toolu_01WwcKcJVHL95pcP8vNd5MD3", "name": "St